			dependencies: ["13A9932D7BCD2E2E"]
			description: [
				"The Order mostly purchases most of their weapons from the Kingdom of Varelia, famous in weapon production, both in firearms and in mystical arms. These weapons have higher ammunition capabilities and can fire multiple rounds before having to reload. Their reload times are much longer and each shot is less powerful."
				""
				"As I do not have the knowledge to manufacture firearms, I should loot firearms that are still working whenever I am able to. Ammunition may be an issue, as I must also loot it off dead soldiers' corpses. I may be able to recover some bullets from the corpses of slain enemies."
