		{
			description: [
				"Two months after the fall of the Queendom of Red Barar. I was lucky to escape the calamity unscathed. My power still remains low and hunters roam the land. They are on my trail. I may not have much longer to write these words."
				""
				"To whoever finds this book, know I am the last of a decimated nobility that once served the Blood Queen. Yes, a noble sanguine. By the time you have read this, we may all have fallen into the abyss of history."
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"I managed to escape the carnage alone, but I do not have much left with me. To keep my sanity intact, I will keep records in this ancient grimoire I found."
				""
				"&4I have a name."
				""
				"You can answer me through the pages? I did not know this was a sentient book."
				""
				"&4My name is Wise Grisha. Your handwriting is familiar to me. It's not as tidy as your grandfather's."
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"Looks like &4Wise Grisha&r will be my only companion for now. An artefact worthy of a noble sanguine such as myself! The only other artefact I was able to retrieve was this mighty bloody living sword. I do not believe it's sentient. "
				""
				"My first priority should be to find a defenceless creature for its blood."
			]
			entity_vis_size: 1.0f
			hide_dependent_lines: true
			icon: "ftbquests:book"
			id: "19AC0B8C0B44FA30"
			rewards: [{
				id: "655E292614567488"
				type: "xp_levels"
				xp_levels: 1
			}]
			size: 1.15d
			subtitle: "The Fall of Red Barar"
			tasks: [{
				id: "2A014AA040A2E5D2"
				stat: "minecraft:walk_one_cm"
				type: "stat"
				value: 100
			}]
			title: "After the Storm"
			x: 2.0d
			y: -2.0d
		}
		{
			description: [
				"&aHere is a useful burst of starting information:"
				""
				"&aYou start as a vampire. Vampires are weak to the sun and fire but undead are not hostile to them. You must drink blood to survive. "
				""
				"&aWhile it may seem like the starting amount of hearts is difficult, the more you level up as a vampire, the more hearts you gain. Furthermore, whenever you eat regular food, you gain a temporary amount of hearts."
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"&aDesecrated is still in development. Currently the following mods are not fully integrated into the pack and its questline but will be very soon: Spectrum, Tetra, and Goety. The modpack is about 70% complete as of now."
				""
				"&aMost quest descriptions are missing, but the progression is still repesented through the quests. Refer to the mods' guidebooks for now. Make sure to update the pack as all quest descriptions will come in the next update."
			]
			entity_vis_size: 1.0f
			icon: "minecraft:knowledge_book"
			id: "6054F9076164BFDE"
			rewards: [{
				id: "5F6B62A0B645526A"
				item: {
					Count: 1
					id: "vampirism:blood_bottle"
					tag: {
						Damage: 9
					}
				}
				type: "item"
			}]
			size: 0.75d
			tasks: [{
				id: "095F7CF043F53178"
				title: "Modpack Author's Note"
				type: "checkmark"
			}]
			x: 2.0d
			y: -1.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["19AC0B8C0B44FA30"]
			description: [
				"I have not fed on man for days! I hunger for warm blood... Alas, human settlements are defended too heavily by these invaders... For now I must feed on small animals. With a few glass bottles, I should be able to stock up on blood for some time."
				""
				"While I am very weak right now, I can eat nutritious food to gain temporary strength. This way, I should be able to withstand greater blows."
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"&a(Press V by default on animals or villagers to drink their blood when you see the icon. Keep glass bottles in your hotbar to fill them with blood instead when you drink blood. Blood production can be automated in the &oFlesh Industries &r&aquest chapter.)"
				""
				"&a(Eating normal food will temporarily grant you extra hearts. These extra hearts are removed after their duration is expended unless you eat again. Some foods can give both food and blood, refer to Vampires' Delight.)"
			]
			entity_vis_size: 1.0f
			id: "416FA3E84EDBA716"
			rewards: [{
				id: "2D42652D4485074D"
				type: "xp_levels"
				xp_levels: 1
			}]
			size: 1.1d
			subtitle: "Crimson Drink"
			tasks: [
				{
					advancement: "vampirism:vampire/first_blood"
					criterion: ""
					id: "3D33A033E9874AEF"
					type: "advancement"
				}
				{
					id: "74B8D8DA35A5EE73"
					item: "minecraft:glass_bottle"
					optional_task: true
					type: "item"
				}
			]
			title: "Sanguine Nutrition"
			x: 2.0d
			y: -6.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["416FA3E84EDBA716"]
			dependency_requirement: "one_started"
			description: [
				"Letting the blood drip from my fangs into the glass bottle, I managed to harvest raw blood. This is undignified! I must find a better solution."
				""
				"&4Little Sanguine, what about a blood sieve? It is able to control the quality of the blood and can automate the process. Any sanguine estate would have high grade sieves."
				""
				"This would be nice.. but I'm ashamed that I don't quite know how to do that."
				""
				"&4I can teach you later."
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"&a(You can right click any container with 1000mb of blood to fill the bottle with blood, whether it be a tank, a grate, etc. You can also throw a bottle into liquid blood blocks to fill the bottle.)"
			]
			entity_vis_size: 1.0f
			id: "3F69B451E4B11129"
			rewards: [
				{
					count: 3
					id: "6B7BA00231B7748F"
					item: {
						Count: 1
						id: "vampirism:blood_bottle"
						tag: {
							Damage: 9
						}
					}
					type: "item"
