		{
			dependencies: ["19AC0B8C0B44FA30"]
			description: [
				"The undead have always been a friendly force to converse with, but to blend in with humans and to obscure my trail, I may need to slay a few of these neutral foes. Their flesh and bones can prove useful after all..."
				""
				"As an undead myself, I am painfully aware of our weaknesses. The sun is a deadly laser. We are vulnerable to fire and holy materials such as silver or gold. However, we are also much more resistant to physical blows than humans are. These zombies and skeletons are the same, although they aren't as grand as a noble sanguine!"
			]
			entity_vis_size: 1.0f
