		{
			dependencies: ["512D4EF547F94803"]
			description: [
				"Our neighbours across the water have always preyed upon our lands. Our sanguine domain stretched across the entire island of Red Barar, but never extended across the water."
				""
				"Now, the Grand Duchy of Gold Barar has landed in the south of the island to conquer our lands. They are hostile to both the Crescent Society and the Starlight Order."
