		{
			dependencies: ["384AD7FA6531C4B9"]
			description: [
				"Gold Barar makes use of the same tactics as the Starlight Order, forming squads of four, equipped with muskets, bayonets and silver bullets to slay every vampire they can find. They are here for our riches, to plunder the countryside and occupy the towns. The non-vampire villagers have welcomed them with open arms. We can no longer use them as blood bags."
				""
				"They will come to rescue any villagers I abduct for my own uses.. They will still come after me nonetheless. I must strengthen my defences."
			]
