			dependencies: ["19AC0B8C0B44FA30"]
			description: [
				"The sun is a terror in the skies above. If I do not set out with an umbrella, I will slowly shrivel up and decay. I should seek to avoid the day as much as possible. "
				""
				"Making a new coffin to pass the day should do. That way, my nocturnal self can sleep during the day. These puny humans aren't nocturnal after all, I can avoid them at night."
			]
