		{
			dependencies: ["19AC0B8C0B44FA30"]
			description: [
				"&4Grisha&r, what's that book?"
				""
				"&4How am I supposed to know? Do you believe all books are my brethren? Ah, the Architectural Encyclopedia of Knowledge. While its authors weren't familiar with sanguine architecture, it should possess the knowledge needed to identify most of the ruins and even the new settlements you will come across."
				""
				"Does it magically know everything?"
				""
				"&4It's a regular tome, nothing more. This edition is quite recent, a nice find!"
				""
				"&a(This item mimics the /wits command, to display the name of the structure the player is located at.)"
			]
			entity_vis_size: 1.0f
			id: "074421F47A443EC7"
			rewards: [
