		}
		{
			dependencies: ["19AC0B8C0B44FA30"]
			description: [
				"&o&7Notes from Eleonore's Travels, Tome I"
				""
				"&fAs one who travels a lot, it's often annoying to either have to setup somewhere and then pack up everything in the morning, or to sleep without shelter. Well, what about simply folding everything into a tent and packing it up?"
				""
				"&fThese tent designs are frequently used by adventurers to serve as a semi-mobile base that is easy to pack and unpack. They can contain a lot more than mere sleeping bags. You can store whole beds, furnaces, even ample storage. They are quite heavy, but still a sufficient lazy solution."
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"&a(Shift-right click the tent to pick it up and its content in one go. "
				""
				"&aZip-up tents can be opened and closed with a right-click.)&r"
			]
			entity_vis_size: 1.0f
			id: "4A8D37AE43828409"
