			description: ["I don't have much time left... The elite hunters of the Starlight Order and Gold Barar will catch up to me soon. I've managed to escape them once only through sheer luck. They have silver bullets and powerful muskets. They are well prepared for a noble sanguine such as I. Worse of all, they come in squads of four."]
