			description: [
				"To escape my pursuers, I may have to learn unorthodox movement techniques. This can be quite useful to break my falls or run much faster. Grisha, do you have anything for that?"
				""
				"&4I recall I ate a book about the moves of assassins. Let me regurgitate it."
				""
				"&a(You can break your fall, cling to walls, mantle up walls, perform charged jumps, crawl, dodge, dive, fast run, wall run, vault, wall jump, and more. There is a hidden stamina bar to these actions.)"
