		{
			dependencies: ["19AC0B8C0B44FA30"]
			description: [
				"As a noble sanguine, I am inherently faster than regular humans and most creatures, but this doesn't mean much if I am wearing heavy armour. Heavier armour is unneccesary for me. My skin is tougher and will gain more powerful vitality than most creatures in due time. Heavy armour will only slow me down."
				""
				"&a(Very light armour grants a 5% speed bonus per piece. Light armour gives no penalties. Medium armour inflicts a 5% speed penalty per piece, heavy armour being 10%, very heavy armour being 15%. Armour also affects gravity. Heavy armour will hamper your jumps and cause you to fall faster.)"
			]
